    "position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ちか",
    "text": "（あっさり片付くかなと思ったんですけど、これは意外と長丁場になるかも……）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 49,
    "dress": "princess",
    "pose": "1",
    "expression": null,
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 472
    },
    "active": true
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ちか",
    "text": "（まぁ、きりのいいところで瓶底メガネが八百長でカップルを成立させるんでしょうけど）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 49,
    "dress": "princess",
    "pose": "1",
    "expression": "princess_expression/expressionless",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 472
    },
    "active": true
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ちか",
    "text": "（単なるごっこ遊び、おままごとの予行練習ですし……。誰が誰とカップルになろうが、結婚しようが知ったことじゃないんですけどね～？）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 49,
    "dress": "princess",
    "pose": "1",
    "expression": "princess_expression/serious",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 472
    },
    "active": true
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ちか",
    "text": "（ちょっと、気になりますね。ヘルプマンは、いったい誰を選んだんでしょう？）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 49,
    "dress": "princess",
    "pose": "1",
    "expression": "princess_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 472
    },
    "active": true
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ちか",
    "text": "（わたしは……。まぁ消去法的に、ヘルプマンの名前を書いたのに。瓶底メガネは論外としても、他のふたりの先輩もまだよく知らないし）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ちか",
    "text": "（あの四人から選ぶなら、ヘルプマンかなって。『誰も選ばない』という選択肢もあったんですけどね～、こんなもん長々とやるのも面倒くさいですし）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 49,
    "dress": "princess",
    "pose": "1",
    "expression": "princess_expression/sad1",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 472
    },
    "active": true
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ちか",
    "text": "（ヘルプマンがわたしを選んでくれたら、そこでお終いにできたのに）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ちか",
    "text": "（カップル不成立だったってことは、ヘルプマンが……。わたし以外の誰かを選んだか、誰も選ばなかったってこと）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 49,
    "dress": "princess",
    "pose": "1",
    "expression": "princess_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 472
    },
    "active": true
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ちか",
    "text": "（にゅ～ん。でもヘルプマンを取っ捕まえて、誰を選んだの？　とか聞くのも変な具合ですしね～。瓶底メガネは進行役だから、そのへん把握してるんでしょうけど）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 49,
    "dress": "princess",
    "pose": "1",
    "expression": "princess_expression/angry1",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 472
    },
    "active": true
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ちか",
    "text": "（あのひとに頭を下げて、無理に聞きだすほどのことじゃないし……。何か変に誤解されて、からかわれそうな気がしますよぉ？）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 49,
    "dress": "princess",
    "pose": "1",
    "expression": "princess_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 472
    },
    "active": true
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ちか",
    "text": "（ヘルプマンって、優柔不断なところがありますしね～。誰も選ばなかった可能性が高いですけど、もしも誰かを選んだとしたら……？）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 49,
    "dress": "princess",
    "pose": "1",
    "expression": null,
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 472
    },
    "active": true
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ちか",
    "text": "（いったい、誰を？　わたし以外の、誰かを選んだってことですよね……。ちづちゃん先輩か、カロアクンか、ナガマチさんのうちの誰かを？）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 49,
    "dress": "princess",
    "pose": "1",
    "expression": "princess_expression/expressionless",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 472
    },
    "active": true
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ちか",
    "text": "（カロアクンでしょうかね、同じ転校生どうしで仲良しだ～って聞いたことがありますし）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ちか",
    "text": "（あるいはナガマチさんでしょうか、今日もふたりで楽しく遊んでたみたいですし）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 49,
    "dress": "princess",
    "pose": "1",
    "expression": "princess_expression/sad1",
